# OpenRouter API key — get one at https://openrouter.ai/keys
# Without the $10 lifetime credit unlock, free models are capped at 50 req/day.
# With $10 loaded (doesn't need to be spent), the cap rises to 1,000 req/day/model.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional: point the IDE at a local OpenAI-compatible server instead of
# OpenRouter. For Rapid-MLX (https://rapidmlx.com) run `rapid-mlx serve <model>`
# and set this to http://localhost:8000/v1 — no API key required. Can also be
# set per-session via the Settings panel; the UI value takes precedence.
# OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/v1
